      "username": "X-metal",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/x-metal/{size}/4892_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-29T23:59:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay so you know megalopolis right? You know how it has polic backup as a card? And you know how cramped quarters combat is a thing, right? Now, you have that, and gloomweaver at low hp, and police backup out, and it being the environment turn and you get the police punching frigging gloomweaver. Or friggin omnitron. Or frigging grand warlord voss. How friggin awesme is that? Just a moment of appreciationg how frigging awesome the megalopolis police are. Rook City, take notes.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:19.993Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
